{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj55qNRVkKYbAgKAWkn4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a cold, unblinking eye.\n\nWhat was open is now closed. What was passage is now barrier.\n\nI stand between here and there, between known and unknown, between you and whatever waits on the other side.\n\nThe bolt is thrown.\n\n**I hold.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":113,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}